package api

var sswCurriculumFisheryBodiesEnglish = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Aturan penangkapan dapat mengatur jenis, ukuran, musim, area, kuota, serta alat. Jangan menganggap semua hasil boleh dibawa hanya karena masuk jaring. Hasil samping dan spesies dilindungi ditangani menurut peraturan serta instruksi kapal, dengan keselamatan manusia diutamakan. Informasi belum pasti perlu dikonfirmasi, bukan ditebak dari foto lama. Pencatatan hasil dan lokasi mendukung keterlacakan serta pengelolaan sumber daya. Limbah alat tangkap tidak dibuang ke laut untuk menghemat ruang.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             `Fishing rules may regulate species, size, season, area, quotas, and gear. Do not assume every catch may be kept just because it entered the net. Handle bycatch and protected species under regulations and vessel instructions, with human safety as the priority. Confirm uncertain information instead of guessing from an old photograph. Recording catch and location supports traceability and resource management. Do not discard fishing-gear waste at sea to save space.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bahan bakar, listrik, mesin panas, dan pekerjaan tertentu dapat menimbulkan kebakaran. Jenis alat pemadam dan penggunaannya mengikuti pelatihan serta sumber bahaya; jangan memakai air pada instalasi listrik bertegangan. Ruang tertutup atau tangki dapat memiliki gas berbahaya maupun kekurangan oksigen. Bau bukan bukti udara aman. Jangan masuk atau melakukan penyelamatan spontan tanpa prosedur ruang terbatas. Ketahui cara memberi alarm, menghubungi nakhoda, dan meninggalkan area melalui jalur yang ditetapkan.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             `Fuel, electricity, hot machinery, and certain tasks can cause fires. Select and use fire extinguishers according to training and the type of hazard; never use water on energized electrical equipment. Enclosed spaces and tanks may contain hazardous gases or lack oxygen. Odor does not prove the air is safe. Do not enter or attempt a spontaneous rescue without the confined-space procedure. Know how to raise the alarm, contact the captain, and leave by the designated route.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Banyak kerang memperoleh makanan dengan menyaring partikel dari air, sehingga kualitas lokasi sangat penting. Sistem tanpa pakan tambahan tetap memerlukan benih, sarana, pengamatan pertumbuhan, kepadatan, dan risiko lingkungan. Penutupan area panen atau peringatan biotoksin harus dipatuhi; mencuci kerang tidak otomatis menghilangkan seluruh bahaya. Jangan menilai keamanan hanya dari cangkang yang tampak normal. Pemindahan, pemanenan, serta pengiriman mengikuti status area dan rencana fasilitas dengan identitas lot yang terjaga.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        `Many shellfish feed by filtering particles from water, so site quality is critical. Systems without supplemental feed still require juvenile stock and facilities, growth and density monitoring, and assessment of environmental risks. Follow harvest-area closures and biotoxin warnings; washing shellfish does not automatically remove every hazard. Do not judge safety only by whether the shells look normal. Move, harvest, and ship stock according to area status and facility plans, maintaining lot identification.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Ada organisme yang status perlindungannya belum diketahui dalam hasil tangkapan. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: konfirmasikan identitas dan prosedur kepada penanggung jawab. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa ketentuan operasi dan spesies; Identifikasi hasil serta hasil samping; Ikuti penanganan yang diperintahkan; Catat dan laporkan temuan khusus. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:        `Consider this work situation: The catch contains an organism whose protected status is unknown. Recommended decision: confirm its identity and handling procedure with the person in charge. Follow an orderly process: check operating rules and species; identify the catch and bycatch; follow the directed handling method; record and report unusual findings. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Ada pemberitahuan resmi penutupan panen pada area kerang. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: hentikan panen sesuai ketentuan dan konfirmasikan status. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa status area serta lot kerang; Amati sarana dan kondisi pertumbuhan; Panen hanya sesuai izin serta rencana; Catat asal waktu dan penanganan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                     `Consider this work situation: An official notice closes the shellfish harvest area. Recommended decision: stop harvesting as required and confirm the area's status. Follow an orderly process: check the area and shellfish-lot status; observe facilities and growth conditions; harvest only as permitted and planned; record origin, time, and handling. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Air wadah angkut dan unit tujuan berbeda jauh suhunya. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: tahan pelepasan langsung dan ikuti prosedur aklimatisasi. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa kondisi organisme dan data asal; Bandingkan lingkungan tujuan; Lakukan aklimatisasi sesuai SOP; Catat pemindahan dan kelainan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                                     `Consider this work situation: The transport-container water and receiving unit differ greatly in temperature. Recommended decision: do not release the stock immediately; follow the acclimation procedure. Follow an orderly process: check the organisms and source records; compare conditions in the receiving environment; acclimate according to SOP; record the transfer and any abnormalities. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Angin menguat dan nakhoda memerintahkan penghentian operasi. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: ikuti penghentian dan pengamanan sesuai instruksi. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa prakiraan serta arahan nakhoda; Pastikan komunikasi dan perlengkapan; Pantau perubahan selama operasi; Patuhi keputusan menunda atau menghentikan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                  `Consider this work situation: The wind is strengthening, and the captain orders operations to stop. Recommended decision: follow the stop-work and securing instructions. Follow an orderly process: check the forecast and the captain's directions; confirm communications and equipment; monitor conditions during operations; follow decisions to delay or stop. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Awak baru diminta mengoperasikan alat yang belum pernah dipelajarinya. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: jelaskan batas kemampuan dan minta pelatihan serta arahan. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Baca rencana dan pembagian tugas kapal; Periksa alat serta perlengkapan pribadi; Ikuti operasi sesuai kewenangan; Catat hasil dan penyimpangan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                           `Consider this work situation: A new crew member is asked to operate equipment they have never learned to use. Recommended decision: explain the limits of your competence and request training and direction. Follow an orderly process: read the plan and vessel duty assignments; inspect the equipment and personal protective gear; take part only within your authority; record results and deviations. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Berat bruto hasil beserta kotak 25 kg dan kotak kosong 5 kg. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: catat netto 20 kg setelah memeriksa data. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa standar sortasi serta lot; Pisahkan jenis dan mutu; Timbang dengan memperhitungkan wadah; Labeli dan serahkan catatan lengkap. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                                               `Consider this work situation: The catch and its container weigh 25 kg gross, and the empty container weighs 5 kg. Recommended decision: record a net weight of 20 kg after checking the figures. Follow an orderly process: check grading standards and lot; separate species and grades; weigh while accounting for the container; label the product and submit complete records. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Biomassa contoh 20 kg dan rencana latihan 2 persen per hari. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: hitung 0,4 kg pakan dan konfirmasikan rencana aktual. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa jumlah hidup dan data berat sampel; Hitung biomassa dengan satuan tepat; Gunakan persentase rencana yang dikonfirmasi; Periksa ulang dan catat pemberian aktual. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                 `Consider this work situation: Sample biomass is 20 kg, and the practice plan uses 2 percent per day. Recommended decision: calculate 0.4 kg of feed and confirm the actual plan. Follow an orderly process: check live-stock counts and sample-weight data; calculate biomass using the correct units; use the confirmed plan percentage; double-check and record the amount actually fed. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Catatan perlakuan kelompok belum lengkap menjelang panen. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: tunda keputusan pelepasan produk sampai status dikonfirmasi. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Konfirmasikan lot mutu dan status perlakuan; Siapkan rencana alat serta wadah panen; Tangani sesuai metode yang diizinkan; Catat jumlah dan penanganan hasil. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                        `Consider this work situation: The lot's treatment records are incomplete shortly before harvest. Recommended decision: hold the product release until its status is confirmed. Follow an orderly process: confirm the lot, grade, and treatment status; prepare the harvest equipment and containers; handle the product using an authorized method; record the amount and handling. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Contoh unit berisi 1000 ekor, 20 mati dan 100 dipindahkan tanpa penambahan. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: catat sisa menurut contoh 880 ekor. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Baca jumlah serta target kepadatan; Periksa ukuran dan kebutuhan grading; Tangani pemisahan sesuai SOP; Perbarui jumlah dan unit kelompok. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                                  `Consider this work situation: A sample unit held 1,000 fish; 20 died and 100 were moved out, with none added. Recommended decision: record 880 remaining in this example. Follow an orderly process: review the count and target density; check size and whether grading is needed; separate the fish according to SOP; update the count and lot unit. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Ditemukan robekan dan sambungan tali lemah sebelum penebaran. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: laporkan dan perbaiki atau ganti sesuai keputusan berwenang. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa spesifikasi serta kondisi jaring; Siapkan posisi awak dan jalur alat; Tebar atau angkat sesuai komando; Lepaskan hasil dan catat kerusakan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                              `Consider this work situation: A tear and a weak rope connection are found before deployment. Recommended decision: report the damage and repair or replace it as authorized. Follow an orderly process: inspect net specifications and condition; position crew and equipment routes; deploy or haul as ordered; release the catch and record damage. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Dua awak menerima perintah mulai yang berbeda saat jaring akan ditarik. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: hentikan ketidakjelasan dan konfirmasikan satu komando yang dipahami. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Dengarkan rencana dan sinyal operasi; Pastikan zona awak aman dari jaring tali; Ikuti urutan penutupan sesuai komando; Periksa alat serta laporkan perubahan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}: `Consider this work situation: Two crew members receive conflicting orders to start as the net is about to be hauled. Recommended decision: stop and clarify until there is one understood command. Follow an orderly process: listen to the operation plan and signals; keep the crew clear of the net and ropes; follow the closing sequence on command; check the equipment and report changes. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Ikan berkumpul di permukaan dan pembacaan oksigen turun dari pola biasa. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: laporkan segera dan jalankan rencana respons kualitas air. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa alat serta titik sampel; Ukur dan catat waktu parameter; Bandingkan dengan target spesies; Laporkan penyimpangan dan ikuti respons. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                             `Consider this work situation: Fish are gathering at the surface, and oxygen readings have dropped below the usual pattern. Recommended decision: report immediately and follow the water-quality response plan. Follow an orderly process: check the equipment and sampling point; measure and record the time and parameter; compare results with the species target; report deviations and follow the response plan. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Instruksi berbunyi 「水温を確認してください」. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: periksa suhu air sesuai metode yang ditetapkan. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Baca unit waktu parameter dan satuan; Konfirmasikan instruksi yang belum jelas; Catat hasil aktual secara objektif; Serahkan laporan dan tugas tindak lanjut. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                                             `Consider this work situation: The instruction says 「水温を確認してください」 (“Please check the water temperature”). Recommended decision: check the water temperature using the specified method. Follow an orderly process: read the parameter, time unit, and measurement unit; clarify any unclear instruction; record the actual result objectively; hand over the report and follow-up task. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Jaring tersangkut dekat roller yang masih berputar. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: hentikan dan isolasi energi sesuai prosedur sebelum penanganan. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa operator alat dan zona aman; Konfirmasikan sinyal mulai dan berhenti; Operasikan dengan pengaman lengkap; Isolasi energi sebelum penanganan sumbatan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                           `Consider this work situation: The net is caught near a roller that is still turning. Recommended decision: stop the equipment and isolate its energy under procedure before handling the blockage. Follow an orderly process: check the equipment operator and safe zone; confirm start and stop signals; operate with all guards in place; isolate energy before clearing a blockage. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Kail tersangkut pada tangan rekan. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: hentikan bahaya sekitar dan minta bantuan sesuai prosedur cedera. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa tali kail dan tugas awak; Siapkan umpan serta posisi aman; Tebar atau tarik mengikuti komando; Amankan kail bekas dan catat cedera. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                                            `Consider this work situation: A hook is caught in a coworker's hand. Recommended decision: stop nearby hazards and request assistance under the injury procedure. Follow an orderly process: check the hook line and crew duties; prepare bait and a safe working position; cast or haul on command; secure used hooks and record the injury. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Kaki seorang awak berada di dalam lingkaran tali sebelum penarikan. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: beri peringatan dan hentikan operasi sesuai prosedur sampai posisi aman. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa kondisi tali dan jalur tarikan; Tentukan posisi di luar zona bahaya; Gunakan simpul sesuai tugas terlatih; Rapikan serta laporkan kerusakan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:           `Consider this work situation: A crew member's foot is inside a rope loop before hauling. Recommended decision: warn the crew and stop operations under procedure until the person is in a safe position. Follow an orderly process: check the rope and line of pull; move outside the hazard zone; use knots appropriate to the trained task; tidy the area and report damage. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Kantong hasil tergantung dan seorang awak hendak melintas di bawahnya. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: cegah melintas dan gunakan jalur aman sesuai komando. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa rencana spesifikasi dan posisi alat; Amankan zona beban serta komunikasi; Ikuti penarikan sesuai komando; Periksa hasil dan kerusakan alat. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                            `Consider this work situation: A catch bag is suspended, and a crew member is about to pass beneath it. Recommended decision: prevent passage and use a safe route as directed. Follow an orderly process: check the gear specifications and equipment position; secure the suspended-load zone and communications; haul on command; inspect the catch and equipment for damage. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
}
